                    1903</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Nashville</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Colon:</hi></p>
                <p>Prevent any armed force of either side from landing at Colon, Porto Bello, or
                    vicinity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moody.</hi></signed></closer>
